2 CONT Relationship to Jacob Israel Belmonte suggested in the text of THE BELMONT-BELMONTE FAMILY book. Doesn't tally with the family tree in the Jewish Encyclopedia or the tree in the back of the book
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.archive.org/details/belmontbelmontef00gott to download a pdf of the book
2 CONT
2 CONT The Belmonte's are a Portuguese Dutch Marano family, which traced its descent from Don Iago y Sampayo, to whom in 1519 King Manuel of Portugal gave the city of Belmonte, allowing him to take the name of the city and to transmit it
2 CONC  to his posterity. In 1522 Don Iago married Andria Mascarenhas. Of his five sons, the one called Bartholomeu Sampayo Belmonte (b. 1525), who married Anna Lancastre, was sent in 1551 on a political mission to the Netherlands, where
2 CONC  he changed his name to "Van Schonenberg."Belmonte Family.
2 CONT
