1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Vasco Fernandes Coutinho''' or also '''Vasco IV Fernandes Coutinho''', '''the Elder''', and in Spanish, '''Vasco Fernández de Melo Coutiño''', '''el Viejo'''.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''1st Lord proprietor of Espírito Santo ("Donatary")'''
2 CONT
2 CONT "Tribute of the Capixabas 
2 CONT To the nobleman of the royal house of Portugal, Vasco Fernandes Coutinho, with a brilliant military career, the first Donatary Captain of the Captaincy of Espírito Santo, being extended to all immigrants who arrived here from May 
2 CONC 23rd, 1535, expanding the Christian faith and the Portuguese empire.
2 CONT Historical and Geographic Institute of Vila Velha.
2 CONT To the 480th Anniversary of the Foundation of Vila Velha and Espírito Santo."
2 CONT
2 CONT Note: Capixabas = people born or living in the State of Espírito Santo.
2 CONT
